{
  "dashboardName": "otel-lab-slo",
  "comment": "Panel nativo AWS complementario del SLO de Grafana (PLAN 3.C). Maximo 3 widgets (decision de coste: GetMetricData se cobra siempre y solo hay 10 metricas custom gratis, por lo que el dashboard completo de 6 paneles vive en Prometheus). Fuentes REALES verificadas en la sesion AWS: los unicos contadores publicados en CloudWatch son los 4 de la lista blanca EMF del collector (namespace OtelLab, dimensiones service.name/cloud.provider/deployment.environment). DESVIACION: el PLAN pedia CPUUtilization del task; el contenedor cloudwatch-agent del task definition muri6 en vivo (exit 1, docs/evidence/02-aws-ecs-session.md) y no hay ContainerInsights (de pago, fuera de lista blanca), asi que NO existe ninguna metrica de CPU en CloudWatch; el tercer widget muestra la salud de las dependencias (db_query_errors_total + payment_authorization_failures_total), el senal de degradacion que si se publica. La CPU vive en el panel 5 de Grafana (hostmetrics via Prometheus).",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Request rate (orders created, EMF)",
        "stat": "Sum",
        "period": 300,
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "OtelLab",
            "orders_created_total",
            "service.name",
            "service-a",
            "cloud.provider",
            "aws",
            "deployment.environment",
            "lab",
            { "id": "m1" }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Error rate (orders_failed / orders_created, %)",
        "stat": "Sum",
        "period": 300,
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "OtelLab",
            "orders_created_total",
            "service.name",
            "service-a",
            "cloud.provider",
            "aws",
            "deployment.environment",
            "lab",
            { "id": "m1" }
          ],
          [
            "OtelLab",
            "orders_failed_total",
            "service.name",
            "service-a",
            "cloud.provider",
            "aws",
            "deployment.environment",
            "lab",
            { "id": "m2" }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "(m2/m1)*100",
              "id": "e1",
              "label": "error ratio %",
              "period": "300"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 6,
      "properties":
     {
        "title": "Dependencia y pagos (sustituto de CPUUtilization: el cw-agent muri6 exit 1 y no hay ContainerInsights; ver comment)",
        "stat": "Sum",
        "period": 300,
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "OtelLab",
            "db_query_errors_total",
            "service.name",
            "service-a",
            "cloud.provider",
            "aws",
            "deployment.environment",
            "lab",
            { "id": "m1" }
          ],
          [
            "OtelLab",
            "payment_authorization_failures_total",
            "service.name",
            "service-a",
            "cloud.provider",
            "aws",
